# agent scratch — process residue, never project source. The vault
# ("WhatNext - docs/") is the single source of truth: durable outcomes land
# there as reports/ADRs/specs and as PR records on merge. Only
# .claude/settings.json stays tracked; everything else under .claude/ is
# cycle/worktree/session residue or machine-local config, so this ignores the
# directory wholesale and opts that one file back in — no pattern to update
# when the tooling renames its scratch dirs again.
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json

# local
TODO.md
QUESTIONS.md

# relay private key — never commit; generate fresh per deployment (see relay/README.md)
relay/relay-key.json
